WEBVTT

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.750
When questioned, should I become a prisoner of war?

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:37.500
I am bound to give only name, rank, service number, and date of birth.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:41.860
I will evade answering further questions to the utmost of my ability.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:48.960
I will make no oral or written statements disloyal to my country and its allies or harmful to their cause.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:07.520
camp is many things but perhaps this above all a kind of dark grasping swamp there is a way out

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:14.110
but not for the one who tries to make firm ground on his own when he loses his head and threshes

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:21.580
about wildly all he does is go deeper and deeper and deeper take the case of two men in the swamp

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:29.750
of an enemy prison camp the first is banks paul j corporal

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:46.060
service number three nine zero two four zero zero eight born 15 august 1936 stupid too stupid to

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:52.120
know that you are just another running dog for wall street you are a dog and i'm going

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:59.580
to treat you like a dog then after saying all those nice things the interrogator gets down to

00:01:59.580 --> 00:01:59.820
business

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:06.840
almost always on the agenda threats of torture withdrawal of food and water the promise of a

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:11.570
physical beating often fiendishly conceived there's no getting away from the fact that

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:18.770
prisoners is a hot seat even when it's a cold one answer my questions and you'll get your clothes back

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:28.560
the hours pass the interrogation continues and the pressure mounts you are from the company

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:37.480
Your commander was Captain Logan, 34th Airborne Infantry. Admit it.

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:44.390
Corporal Banks admits nothing beyond name, rank, service number, and date of birth.

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:48.960
He knows that is the only way not to be sucked into the swamp.

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:54.720
The second prisoner, named Joe Campbell.

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:59.650
He has a rank, PFC, which he has revealed along with his service number.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:07.520
and date of birth so far that's all so far so good but not as far as the interrogator is concerned

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:15.060
an old pro he can spot the waiver the man who pushed the panic button it's his job to find it

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.300
and rarely does he use a direct approach.

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:23.170
I've got to go a few minutes next door now.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:29.400
I leave my cigarettes and light up.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:43.030
And while I am gone, look this over, you'll find on it more than 800 signatures of your own people already.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:47.190
Look it over and sign it.

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.820
That will be all, can't spell.

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:05.210
The guy will take you back to your balance.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:07.620
Wait a minute.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:10.680
Sit down.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:22.010
I don't see how three of those signatures could be there.

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:26.410
Those guys were in my outfit.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.980
They were killed last week.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:41.760
the bait was snapped up poor fish in the dark hours of the night when a prisoner's body and

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:47.480
mind yearns for sleep for much needed rest it's then they come the inquisitors

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:20.800
The guys that came in today sang real loud at interrogation, I hear.

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:25.210
Sticks it up already.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:31.600
What's the matter?

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.140
Oh, I'd have given a thousand to one.

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:35.240
It was me they were after.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:38.880
No, the guy they took signed something out here.

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:42.180
Once they get you on that hook, they never leave you going.

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:43.780
They know they got a pigeon.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.970
Once they can make you talk even about the weather,

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:51.400
they'll never quit trying to make you talk about everything you know.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:58.910
Take this microphone and read into it aloud the words in front of you.

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:14.070
never signed anything i won't do it i admit that before being captured i shot and killed the

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:27.390
civilian in occupied territory that's a lie i never saw that i never signed that look tampo

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:43.420
in an empty space your signature campbell you are confessed war criminal campers to do as we wish

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:55.480
with if you ever want to see your home again take this microphone breathe in a natural voice you are

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:56.960
speaking to your friends

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:29.980
Yes.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:46.200
see joe campbell listen you guys quit while you're ahead while you're alive i mean you don't have a

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:58.940
chance i know it's you're good here don't don't believe what you're told about

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.040
How these guys treat prisoners

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:33.440
I hate to think how close I came to spilling my guts when I got the pressure.

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:37.940
Be glad you didn't. Don't think you're an exception.

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:44.440
In here, apologies for collaboration with the enemy are positively not accepted.

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:49.690
Regular morning discussion period, one hour after chow.

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:57.220
Hey, discussion about what?

00:08:58.480 --> 00:08:59.860
Well, you got three choices.

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:04.640
Under the wire, through the wire, or over the wire.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:23.100
Under the wire.

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:51.870
When questioned, should I become a prisoner of war?

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:56.960
I am bound to give only name, rank, service number, and date of birth.

